window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Will love be a critical success or an untimely end to the campaign?</p> <p>Mika Levenberg is over relationships. After her ex-girlfriend cheats on her, all Mika wants to do is make good food and play the tabletop role-playing game Bargains &amp; Battles with her friends every week.</p> <p>Ash Aguila is new to Washington DC. After escaping an abusive relationship, he’s looking to start over in the Capitol and try to rebuild himself. When his cousin invites him to play a game called Battles &amp; Bargains, Ash reluctantly agrees to try something new. At least he can meet some new people.</p> <p>When he meets Mika, he discovers that passion can spark across the tabletop. Will Mika and Ash take a chance and roll the dice on love?</p>"; 
